hapterId":"1l93wyyn97p5n","dataSize":1432,"chapterOrder":23,"inChapterOrder":1,"volumeId":"7520927815609352211","volumeVersion":5},{"paragraphId":"7535740233330769930","paragraphType":1,"content":"{\"lines\":[{\"lineId\":\"11\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"順天府治在地安門外鼓樓東，即元大都路總治舊署。明爲順天\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"12\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"府，\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"13\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"大淸一統志：王直重修順天府記畧：至元中，大都路躎治無定制，至或假民房以庀事。其後乃市諸民，得地二十畝爲屋。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"14\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"以居。我朝有天下，改大都路爲北平府。永樂元年，北京經，又改北平府爲順天府，因故署爲治。孫承澤春明夢餘錄：順天府治即\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"15\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":3,\"content\":\"\",\"pagePass\":{\"PageId\":\"7520927337497919522\"},\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"16\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"元大都路總治舊署也。元初，官吏辦事佛寺中。至大中，監路平章政事莫吉奏請以錢四萬二千五百緡買靈椿里周氏地，計十九\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"17\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"畝，建爲公署。永樂定鼎於此，遂因其署而爲順天府。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"18\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"本朝因之。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null}],\"indent\":0,\"textIndent\":false}","startPageId":"7520927337497903138","endPageId":"7520927337497919522","contentEncryptType":0,"translateContent":"","chapterId":"1l93wyyn97p5n","dataSize":1300,"chapterOrder":23,"inChapterOrder":2,"volumeId":"7520927815609352211","volumeVersion":5},{"paragraphId":"7558397535196348426","paragraphType":1,"content":"{\"lines\":[{\"lineId\":\"19\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"府尹署南嚮，門三重，堂三楹，室字壯麗，規模宏敞。堂西\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"20\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"北爲演耕所，東爲土穀祠，西爲包公祠。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"21\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"順天府明舊册。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"22\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"萬厤二十五年，\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"23\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"大堂災，三十六年重建。有碑記，在堂後空院東，其西有元大都路\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"24\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"碑，劉賡書。碑陰趙孟頫書。大門内西隅。光緒八年，添置候審所，府\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"25\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"尹周家楣奏立。堂後設東西轅門、大門、儀門，𠀤南向。儀門内爲聽\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"26\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"事堂，東爲知愧齋，\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"27\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"采訪冊秦瀛順天府署知愧齋記畧：知愧齋者，府尹聽事堂之東，余所居，以治文書，接僚屬。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"28\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"者也。尹之名始見於尙書。漢時京兆尹，其秩頗尊，唐、宋以來，韓、歐諸公皆嘗爲之。而包孝肅之治開封也，風裁峻厲，有閻羅、包老之\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"29\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"目今順天府府尹官廨有包公祠，先是，蔚州魏敏果爲府尹，嘗書於聽事之堂日：我愧包公，其額尙存。余不敏，才行無似，乃亦來跡。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"30\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"其任，聽事於茲，實懼且恧，因顏其堂東之室曰知愧齋。舊制，三品衙門印皆用銅，惟府尹得用銀印，蓋重之也。乾隆十四年後，雖特\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"31\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"簡大臣兼管，而印仍歸府尹。肅淸畿甸，鎮撫百姓，宜思有以塞是職者。顧數十年來，因循窳惰，僅成𤲯諸，於一切政事，概讓之總督。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"32\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":3,\"content\":\"\",\"pagePass\":{\"PageId\":\"7520927337497935906\"},\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"33\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"即兼管大臣，亦懔不復詰，優游拱手，靜若無事，而部臺得以勢相諉，起而撓之，苦任事一不當，則輦轂下耳目甚近，物論蜂起，聲名\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"34\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"易敗以不專之權，加以易撓之勢，重以易敗之名，其爲可憂也甚矣。而澤不被於三輔，化不行於列牧，鳥能無愧乎？\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"35\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"聽事堂\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"36\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"後爲内宅。道光十八年，府尹曾望顔重修，\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"37\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"采訪冊：按日下舊聞載有天星堂、候氣室，今\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"38\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"久無考。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"39\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"光緒九年，府尹周家楣重修。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"40\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"采訪冊\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"41\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"府丞署舊在大門内東北隅，久廢。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"42\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"采訪冊\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null}],\"indent\":0,\"textIndent\":false}","startPageId":"7520927337497919522","endPageId":"7520927337497935906","contentEncryptType":0,"translateContent":"","chapterId":"1l93wyyn97p5n","dataSize"