inYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"56\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"采訪冊：又捕盜營弁駐所，在經厯署後。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"57\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":3,\"content\":\"\",\"pagePass\":{\"PageId\":\"7520927337497952290\"},\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"58\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"順天學政署在扁担胡同，道光十六年建。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"59\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"采訪册學署詳學校，各州縣均同。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null}],\"indent\":0,\"textIndent\":false}","startPageId":"7520927337497935906","endPageId":"7520927337497952290","contentEncryptType":0,"translateContent":"","chapterId":"1l93wyyn97p5n","dataSize":1702,"chapterOrder":23,"inChapterOrder":4,"volumeId":"7520927815609352211","volumeVersion":5},{"paragraphId":"7558397535196364810","paragraphType":1,"content":"{\"lines\":[{\"lineId\":\"60\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"大興縣治在安定門迤南教忠坊，南向。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"61\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"縣舊冊\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"62\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"明永樂中建。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"63\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"見冰鑑堂記。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"64\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"大門至署宅共六層。土地祠、監獄𠀤在大門内。其堂爲冰鑑堂，乾\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"65\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"隆二十七年，知縣仁和周贄新修，\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"66\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"采訪冊周贄大興縣冰鑑堂記：大興古幽州域，其名昉於金。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"67\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"源明永樂中，始建縣署，落畿輔，東北隅爲京兆左翊。顧地勢庫下，遇暴雨則爲水壑，屢修屢壞，居者困焉。丁丑春，余蒞是邦，覩舍傾\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"68\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"圮，每歲捐俸修葺爲常。嵗辛巳，大雨時行，積水深四五尺。今年雨復連旬，傾圮益甚。夫大興，首邑也，衙署，公所也。今𥣧廢若此，其曷\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"69\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"以樹華封之望。於是吿大吏，咨虞部，動帑金若干兩，鳩工庀材。首疏水道，繼築階除，又增高舊址尺有五寸，其餘棟楹板檻之撓剝。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"70\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"者，蓋瓦級甎之破缺者，赤白之漫漶不鮮者，並治之。币月之間，門牆𪠘宇皆復舊規，而茲堂乃煥然一新矣。昔裴延晉爲幽州剌史，\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"71\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"修復督亢渠，漑田萬頃。焦旭爲大興令，勤恤民隱，無使失所。此二公者，均匪以求一身之安。余於聽事之庭，亟爲整治，豈徒飾觀聸。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"72\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"謀棲息而己哉。國家重熙累洽，百有餘年，首善之區，風湻俗美，先訓行以進光，尤稱易治。則夫新斯堂也，所爲明作有功，冀以宣\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"73\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"上德而厚民生者，誠不可忽己。堂故\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"74\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"同無\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"75\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"額落成，顔口氷鑑，蓋用以自朂云。治十二年，知縣上元汪\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"76\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"家勲重修。光緒九年，府尹周家楣、知縣管近修重修。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"77\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"采訪冊：按：大、宛兩縣牙。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"78\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":3,\"content\":\"\",\"pagePass\":{\"PageId\":\"7520927337497968674\"},\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"79\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"署，編列在前，重其地也。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"80\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"縣丞署在禮賢鎮，距縣治一百里。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"81\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"采訪冊\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"82\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"典史署在縣治大門内。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"83\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"采訪冊\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"84\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"巡檢司三，其暑一在禮賢鎮，距縣一百里；一在采育鎮，距縣七十\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"85\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"里，一在黃村鎮，距縣五十里。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"86\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"采訪冊\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"87\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"慶豐閘閘官署在二閘門之南。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"88\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"采訪冊\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null}],\"indent\":0,\"textIndent\":false}","startPageId":"7520927337497952290","endPageId":"7520927337497968674","contentEncryptType":0,"translateContent":"","chapterId":"1l93wyyn97p5n","dataSize":4019,"chapterOrder":23,"inChapterOrder":5,"volumeId":"7520927815609352211","volumeVersion":5},{"paragraphId":"7558397535196381194","paragraphType":1,"content":"{\"lines\":[{\"lineId\":\"89\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"宛平縣治在地安門外迤西積慶坊，南向。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"90\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"縣舊冊\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"91\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"大門至署宅共六\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"92\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"層。監獄在大門内。二堂東爲古墨齋，萬厤六年，邑令李蔭建，以雲\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"93\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"麾殘石甃之壁。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"94\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"國朝乾隆五十八年，武進胡遜重建，\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"95\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"采訪冊燕都游覧志：古墨齋，在宛平縣署内，唐李北海所書。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"96\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"雲麾將軍碑，邑令李薩購得，甃之，壁署翁方綱古墨齋記。明從將軍碑雲化。黎瑶石古墨齋記畧云：良鄉縣學有北海所書雲麾。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"97\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"麾名秀，幽州人。碑舊在官𪠘，不知何時校官裂爲柱礎，好古者深惜之。近復脩學舍，更以新砥，置而不用，推之瓦礫中，過者不聣也。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"98\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":3,\"content\":\"\",\"pagePass\":{\"PageId\":\"7520927337497985058\"},\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"99\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"人正董生鳳元徃經其地，蹤跡之，則古礎存焉。以語宛友邵生魁平令李侯，侯喟然興歎，寓書良鄉令輩至都下，搆齋於寢室之右。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"100\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"李宛平唱和者也。是記作於萬厤六年戊寅夏六月。黎民表字惟敬，號瑶石，廣州從化人，時官内閣中書舍人。歐大任字楨伯，南海\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"101\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"人，時官國子監博士。是時又有盱眙李言恭、亳州朱宗吉，皆同賦雲麾將軍斷碑歌者也。按是碑逸人太原郭卓然摹勒，並題額。李\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"102\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"惟儉攜四礎之大鿄，今僅存二礎，可辨者數十字而已。董兆王其文敏得宋拓殘本，是未作礎以前者，凡數百字。而戯鴻堂摹勒四\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"103\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"十七行，三百二十八字，綴集成句，訛失頗多，且不著是碑之名，觀者憾焉。予去年於吳門借摹董藏舊本，而適武進蕙麓胡子來知\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"104\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"宛平事政成務暇，雅稽古蹟，勒爲二石，去其泐蝕者，文雖未全，恰與鶴堂行數相等，得三百六十有三字，以視昔日李侯所得六礎。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"105\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"秀字元秀，卒於開元四年，𦵏范陽福祿鄉。劉侗帝京景物畧云：李蔭所得六礎，共存百八十餘字，碑首尙存唐故雲三字。其後少京。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"106\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"納礎壁間，屬藩參王子世懋，署曰古墨齋。李侯曁歐子大任諸君士集中，嘗與歌以落之。侯名薩，字于美，南陽人。工詩，善書法歐博。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"107\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"之字，乃倍過之。予爲重書古墨齋扁，復李侯之舊觀，存北海之妙蹟，紀都門之掌故，資藝林之攷据，並撮述黎記大畧，以補吳記所\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"108\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"未備同云治五年，知縣余汝修重修。光緒九年，府尹周家楣、知縣蔡\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"109\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"夀臻重修。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"110\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"采訪冊\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"111\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"縣丞署舊在縣治大門内，後移住門頭溝。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"112\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"采訪冊\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"mar