南。康熙二十六年，直隸巡\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"159\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"撫于成龍奏建。同治十一年，同知郝聯薇重修。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"160\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"通州高志\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"161\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"司獄署。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"162\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":3,\"content\":\"\",\"pagePass\":{\"PageId\":\"7520927337498034210\"},\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"163\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"南路捕盜同知署在大興縣之黃村，乾隆五年重建，\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"164\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"采訪冊王者輔重建公。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"165\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"署碑記畧：康熙二十七年，朝議從直隸巡撫于成龍之請，畿輔迈地，特設四路同知，而南路則領一州八縣，駐右安門外三十五里。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"166\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"大興縣之黃村，地當孔道，曠野人稀，時有萑苻之患，故置官吏，建𪠘宇，并設干把三員，馬步兵百名隸麾下。蓋以緝奸宄爲至易，而\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"167\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"察九州縣之吏治民生，亦至便也。嗣𪠘宇以年久圮壞，雍正三年夏，復爲暴水所衝。前丞程君鳳文以議修建，則爲費不貲，不若僦\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"168\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"居，徐圖其後，因移治於村南二十五里之龎閣莊，斯亦一時權宜之策也。後乃安士重遷，憚復故址，溷官府於市廛，疲兵民於奔命。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"169\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"如是者十有四年。乾隆三年冬，子承乏莅茲，士相形勢，度機宜，益信前人議駐黃村有深意，確不可移，爰刻狀白當事，請復舊治。俱\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"170\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"報可，即鳩工庀材，戒期書役。經始於乾隆四年正月二十四日，三閱月而廳署落成。又建大堂三間，以爲蒞事臨民之所。堂以前儀。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"171\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"門大門廊房計三十四間，内左右翼一十八間，即爲嵗科童子考試地。堂以後爲室五十有一間，齋舍、庖湢、供帳器用之屬，莫不畢\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"172\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"具。署旣成，復移治於此。復度隙地，於署之東偏建書院十有四間，具脩脯，延塾師，使野處之秀咸得就學。署之西偏，則建三廳，以爲\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"173\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"武員公署拓地四干，弓搆營房百有八閒，以居步騎之士。暇則親涖，以時肄習之。弦歌之聲與鳴鏑之聲相和，期月以來，氣象稍已。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"174\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"改觀。然則啟此字，宅此士，以仰𠄘國家建署之本意，又烏可已哉？至於考廢興得失之迹，而增益其所未備，以盡其職之所當爲。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"175\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"是有待於後之涖茲任者。工旣成，爰礱石以志始未。采訪冊。東偏書院十四間，西偏三廳武弁公署、營房百有八間，早已無存。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"176\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":3,\"content\":\"\",\"pagePass\":{\"PageId\":\"7520927337498050594\"},\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"177\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"光緒六年，同知陶彦夀重修。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"178\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"廳冊\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"179\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"司獄署。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"180\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"西路捕盜同知署在蘆溝橋。康熙二十八年建，有碑。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"181\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"廳冊按：碑記即西路同。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"182\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"知祝兆麒詳請勒石公牘，其畧云：自設西路捕盜衙門以來，幾及二載，官無公署，無以昭體統，兵無房舍，無以安棲止，致厲憲台淵\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"183\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"衷，乃不欲以之縻國帑，而勸諭庶司，公捐起蓋，某又何敢旁𫌿，隨即躬爲經營，次第就理。其兵房久經報完，今公署亦已吿竣矣。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"184\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"旣蒙題設捕盜之官，復添設𣑛盗之兵，旣建造各廳之署，𠀤甯衆弁兵之居，將四路官制營規，屹然爲甸服之屏障矣。敢𣂕特賜鴻\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"185\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"文勤之貞珉，以昭示來茲，使後之蒞是官者。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"186\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"道\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"187\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"得以覧止焉。云云。康熙二十八年凡月勒石。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"188\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"光二十七年重修。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"189\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"采訪冊\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"190\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"司獄署。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"191\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"北路捕盜同知署在昌平州城南二十里鞏華城。鞏華城舊爲沙\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"192\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"河店地，明嘉靖十九年築城戍守。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"193\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"詳城池。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"194\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"本朝設北路同知駐此。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"195\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"廳冊\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"196\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"同治十二年五月，同知鄭沂開工重修，\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"197\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":3,\"content\":\"\",\"pagePass\":{\"PageId\":\"7520927337498066978\"},\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"198\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"光緒元年十二月工竣。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"199\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"昌平，宋志。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"200\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"司獄署光緒二年，司獄戴繼恩重修。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"201\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"㕔冊\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null}],\"indent\":0,\"textIndent\":false}","startPageId":"7520927337498017826","endPageId":"7520927337498066978","contentEncryptType":0,"translateContent":"","chapterId":"1l93wyyn97p5n","dataSize":7595,"chapterOrder":23,"inChapterOrder":15,"volumeId":"7520927815609352211","volumeVersion":5},{"paragraphId":"7558397535196413962","paragraphType":1,"content":"{\"lines\":[{\"lineId\":\"202\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"良郷縣治在城内西偏，明正統中，知縣王弻建。正德初，知縣孟純\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"203\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"繕葺。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"204\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"良鄉楊志劉武臣重修良鄉縣署碑畧：良鄉古燕中都地，今爲畿第一劇縣，路控東、西、南三方，内外，大小臣工之宣納。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"205\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"詔令者禀承職事者，朝者賀者，往返必信㝛焉，將迎無虚日。令以下若丞、若簿若典史皆分屬諸路以候，及暮始歸，秉燭視事無幾。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"206\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"文移山積於前，命吏抽檢，取其利害之尤切且近者，料埋而已。帑藏竭於供餽，車徒困於奔馳，民不能支，至轉徙他郡。若是者皆不\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"207\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"暇問也，而況於縣署乎？良鄉縣署，正統中，前令王君實建之，迄今餘六十寒暑，日就敝陋。令於茲者，非不欲新之也，皆坐劇不能耳。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"208\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"孟君德厚以郷進士來令茲縣，歎曰：此亦天子輦轂之下，而縣署乃爾，豈所以壯京師，示多方哉？雖然，當先其急者。遂銳然抑豪强。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"209\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"去奸宄，祛弊蠧，雪𡨚滯，賑窮乏。未幾，竭者足，困者起，轉徙者還，四境之內，協然大治。乃澈縣治而新之，自瓦磚鍛礪，以及竹木，凡營\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"210\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"構，所需者如取諸左右然，羣匠皆駭愕，相顧以爲異。蓋君自履任來，己屬心於此，官府有羡，輒儲之，而人不及知也。工凡九閱月，而\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"211\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"完，總若干楹宇。其高，翼翼其整，炳炳其黝堊，加於舊規，信數侶不啻矣。始，縣署之未新也，士民懼其將厲已，頗以爲念。至是歡甚，益\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"212\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"德君謀，勒石圖不朽，且以爲將來者之勸。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"213\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":3,\"content\":\"\",\"pagePass\":{\"PageId\":\"7520927614819631104\"},\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"214\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"本朝仍之。其堂爲忠愛堂縣，光緒六年，知縣彭慶颺重修。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"215\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"良郷新志\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"216\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"縣丞署在縣署迤南。縣舊在縣署忠愛堂東，\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"217\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"又舊有主簿署，在忠。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"218\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"咸\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"219\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"愛堂西，久廢。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"220\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"豐四年，縣丞白維移建於此。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"221\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"良鄉新志\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"222\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"典史署在縣治儀門迤東，光緒二年，典史陳國祥重修。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"223\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"良鄉新志\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"224\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"防守禦署、防禦署𠀤在縣東街。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"225\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"采訪冊\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"226\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"守備署在東門迤南\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"227\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"采訪冊\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"228\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"北頭工下汎。宛平縣丞署在本汎十二號。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"229\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"永定河續志\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":