ent\":\"\",\"pagePass\":{\"PageId\":\"7520927614819778560\"},\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"410\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"揆偀因署坍圯，賃屋而居，基址并入州署，今駐北關。石壩公𪠘\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"411\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"高志\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"412\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"駐郭。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null}],\"indent\":0,\"textIndent\":false}","startPageId":"7520927614819762176","endPageId":"7520927614819778560","contentEncryptType":0,"translateContent":"","chapterId":"1l93wyyn97p5n","dataSize":773,"chapterOrder":23,"inChapterOrder":34,"volumeId":"7520927815609352211","volumeVersion":5},{"paragraphId":"7558397535196512266","paragraphType":1,"content":"{\"lines\":[{\"lineId\":\"413\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"管河州判署在州南漷縣城內東北隅，即漷縣舊治。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"414\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"高志岳正漷。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"415\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"縣奉敕重建記：漷畿縣，附京師不百里。永樂初，置九屯，募致徒者。後薦沴，相繼亡去。繼今屯遺十餘家，士著之民，不滿千戸爲之代。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"416\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"輸田疏鹵，耕費而寡獲，當南北永陸之會，小有力者不業本，輒事輓載以逐利，婦女荒於蠶織，但饋餉以佐夫，男加役重，賦穰官吏。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"417\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"因之以漁獵。故邑無郛郭，肆市大小，公宇圯毀，湫穢，蕩如村墟。郊民掤土𦭞茅以逃。風曰：俗使氣仗節，有怨報訐，不爲死惜。遠近傳\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"418\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"爲醜地，選人得除，即抑首悵然。賀者匪慰則唁，雖吾士人亦自陋，無敢舉以誇詡他邑者。天順初，吾得罪西戍，吾伯氏以書報曰：邑\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"419\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"喜得大夫甚賢而材，比吾賜還，已四闓嵗。始入吾境，則戸有園圃，屋有瓦甓，積有庾廥，畜有孳牲，婦女老稚，衣被鮮澤。旣入吾郊，則\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"420\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"貿易有集，溝窪，有梁。巡院、邑治、學宮，棲神之祠，崇祀之所，有殿廡，有庭堂，有廂齋、舍館、壇臺，重有倉庫，微有庖湢，或崇而隆，或厰而\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"421\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"明或閎麗而華靚，雄規傑創，炳然一新，且復興於廢，易陋爲壯，何爲而然也？詢諸父老，日由吾大夫賈侯也。侯之始至，實恤吾民，均\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"422\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"徭役，課樹藝，誅游手，禁浮費，攻苦食澹，以身先之。曾不二年，弱者以健，踣者以起，强梁者以納朒，而貪并者歛避侯度，吾民之知方。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"423\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"而可使也。東西道䆢，瀦潦没焉，試垘而杠之，應者如赴，數日告成。於是旋圖繕營，若新若甓，若木、若石、若甎，若灰堊、釘鐵，丹漆若工。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"424\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"之價，役之餼，皆以方畧致之。旣具上聞，詔曰：可。天順五年辛巳正月經始。明年五月，公宇成。十月，巡院成，又明年，城隍廟成，又明年。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"425\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":3,\"content\":\"\",\"pagePass\":{\"PageId\":\"7520927614819794944\"},\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"426\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"七月，學宮成，凡爲屋大小千有餘杜。漷故州也，殘之兵燹。同知州事錢塘楊思賢氏，初草具之，洪武庚戌，降而偁縣，建今百年，敝宜。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"427\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"矣。兹以甚困之邑，欲成巨麗之觀，不資財於公，不藉力於私，而久罷方甦之民，如醉醒寐覺，坐視厥就。若吾大夫之嘉惠吾漷爲吾\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"428\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"漷人者，宜何如其報可耶？共意大夫之政，己爲御史所舉，吾君知之，吾相知之，當有旌擢之襃。儻逸駕莫攀，深仁何徯？予能辭而記。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"429\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"之，使嗣吾大夫者，如吾大夫之用心，豈惟是功也得以時葺而不壞，將漷之人亦因是而有所永賴哉！噫！父老之言是也，況吾亦漷。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"430\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"人其能忘情乎？大夫名貞，字子固，其先世居淮揚，先君子宦於莒幕，今爲莒人。當時成大夫之志，則有若主簿光州楊先、陽谷張傑。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"431\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"典史維揚顏鏡、邑大夫士董昱、馬驥、父老武傑等，并列碑陰云。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"432\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"乾隆四十年，州判李炳因署内隙\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"433\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"地二畝許，中有古槐，僅存其半，即其地倚槐治亭，名曰半槐亭。是\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"434\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"年，州判蔣縹接任，詳修衙署。四十一年，州判龍文鑣接任承修，添\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"435\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"造住房三間，內書房三間，簽押房三間，馬棚四間，𠀤顔二堂額曰\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"436\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"半剌堂。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"437\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"高志\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"438\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"吏目署在州治大門内西。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"439\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"高志\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"440\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"驛丞兼巡檢署在州張家灣城內。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"441\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"高志\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":nu