{\"lineId\":\"455\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"此。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"456\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"言志。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"457\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"石壩掣斛廳在州石壩，有大官廳，舊名督儲館，爲州判督漕公𪠘，\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"458\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"每年南糧抵通，移駐於此。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"459\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"高志\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null}],\"indent\":0,\"textIndent\":false}","startPageId":"7520927614819778560","endPageId":"7520927614819811328","contentEncryptType":0,"translateContent":"","chapterId":"1l93wyyn97p5n","dataSize":7462,"chapterOrder":23,"inChapterOrder":35,"volumeId":"7520927815609352211","volumeVersion":5},{"paragraphId":"7535740238053179419","paragraphType":1,"content":"{\"lines\":[{\"lineId\":\"460\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"通協副總府衙門在州新城西門内帥府街。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"461\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"高志\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null}],\"indent\":0,\"textIndent\":false}","startPageId":"7520927614819811328","endPageId":"7520927614819811328","contentEncryptType":0,"translateContent":"","chapterId":"1l93wyyn97p5n","dataSize":232,"chapterOrder":23,"inChapterOrder":36,"volumeId":"7520927815609352211","volumeVersion":5},{"paragraphId":"7535740238053244955","paragraphType":1,"content":"{\"lines\":[{\"lineId\":\"462\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"左營都司署在州新城内小紅牌樓前。乾隆十四年，都司趙登高、\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"463\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":3,\"content\":\"\",\"pagePass\":{\"PageId\":\"7520927614819827712\"},\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"464\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"知州朱奎揚以民人孟三入官房屋詳建。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"465\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"高志\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"466\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"張灣營都司署在州張家灣城内。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"467\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"高志\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"468\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"左營守備署在州治西南。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"469\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"高志采訪冊：千總以下，或賃民房，或居汎地，無定所，不冘書。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null}],\"indent\":0,\"textIndent\":false}","startPageId":"7520927614819811328","endPageId":"7520927614819827712","contentEncryptType":0,"translateContent":"","chapterId":"1l93wyyn97p5n","dataSize":948,"chapterOrder":23,"inChapterOrder":37,"volumeId":"7520927815609352211","volumeVersion":5},{"paragraphId":"7558397535196528650","paragraphType":1,"content":"{\"lines\":[{\"lineId\":\"470\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"三河縣治在城西北隅。明洪武初建，正統間重修。中爲牧愛堂，東\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"471\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"爲典史廳，西爲財賦庫。後堂爲知縣住宅，東爲縣丞宅，縣丞裁，主\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"472\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"簿居之，主簿裁，典史居之。典史廳南東面爲吏、戸、禮、承發司、架閣\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"473\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"庫、儀仗房、財賦庫南西面爲兵、刑、工、馬政、科鋪、長司房。儀門西爲\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"474\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"禁獄，前爲大門，上有譙樓。大門外爲申明堂，西爲旌善亭。萬麻十\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"475\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"二年，知縣王自謹重建。土地祠、馬神廟、監獄房。嘉靖四十五年，知\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"476\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"縣崔璵重建大門、譙樓、寅賓館，此舊制也。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"477\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"國朝康熙二年，知縣李炳重修。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"478\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"三河陳志李炳重修三河縣署記：余左遷通州判官之五年，嵗在\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"479\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"癸卯仲春，攝三河篆，甫蒞任，初未詳三河之所名，而縣署湫溢傾圯，釐然在目矣。余謂署曰公署，門曰公門，堂日公堂，蓋辦公之地。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"480\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":3,\"content\":\"\",\"pagePass\":{\"PageId\":\"7520927614819844096\"},\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"481\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"也，傾圯不治，如辦公何？五月，奉文陞任。茲士恭逢天子展謁祖陵，幸盛京，邑當其衝，驛使絡繹，余未遑别有營作。越明\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"482\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"年甲辰，倡捐謀所以修之，書役亦樂輸有差。計得白金若干兩。舊制照牆距大門若干尺，移置道南，去新建大門若干尺。義門舊制。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"483\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"一間，今移舊大門三間易之，去大門若干尺，去大堂若干尺，東西雨角門如制。大堂兩廊各設科房六間，比舊宏堅如式。戒石碑久。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"484\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"廢，補立如初。大門内東爲士地祠，舊祀雜𡚶，僅留専祠如祀與西設班房一區，各班環列焉。門西遥接監獄，再西爲晾馬厰，築垣屏。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"485\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"留泃陽驛路，復舊制也。東西設坊二，棹楔臨洵舊治左輔巖疆八字。經始於某年某月，落成於某月。按新唐書：武德二年，析潞縣置。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"486\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"臨泃。開元四年，更置三河郡邑。釋名：三河，以地近七渡、鮑邱、泃河三水名。城邑考：三河舊城，在今縣東三里洵河南，建於石趙，廢於\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"487\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"後魏今之三河城，即趙德鈞所置。水經注：洳河源出北山，東南經平谷縣故域西，而東注於洵河。考三河志，洳水即錯河，一名七度。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"488\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"河泃水即錯河之支河，平時乾涸，霖雨成河。鮑邱河自順義入境，至時管營，始有河形，每遇霖雨，積水成河。夫源遠流長者，河也。七\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"489\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"渡是也。忽盈忽涸者，行潦也，泃與鮑邱是也。行潦不可以爲河，泃與鮑邱豈得與七渡𠀤偁三河耶？且置邑命名，往往本諸山川義。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"490\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"取切實，如五臺以臺名，三水以水名，確有其數，而因以得名之類是也。以河名矣，亦奚取於無源之行潦，而附會以名三河耶？及攷\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"491\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"三河輿圖：七渡河自靑陽屯入境，南流由舊城西北繞城而東，而南，而西而東南至料馬莊出境，形若半壁，而舊城適當其缺，故云。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"492\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"然則以三面環河名三河，可，謂地名七渡、鮑邱、泃三水，則不可也。水經注謂泃水出右北平無極縣西山，鮑邱，出禦彝北塞者，豈陵。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"493\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":3,\"content\":\"\",\"pagePass\":{\"PageId\":\"7520927614819860480\"},\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"494\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"谷變遷，今昔不同歟？抑酈未經其地，而以訛傳訛歟？余旣重修三河署，而因辨其命名之義，俾後之君子知所考云。知縣事皋蘭李\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"495\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"炳記。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"496\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"十八年，地震俱圯。知縣任塾重修公廨。二十五年，知縣彭鵬建\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"497\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"馬神廟於署西。三十年，知縣張鼐建土地祠於署東南。三十六年，\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"498\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"知縣張朝琮建倉房六間，監房六間。三十九年，知縣鄭富民建科\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"499\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"房六間。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null}],\"indent\":0,\"textIndent\":false}","startPageId":"7520927614819827712","endPageId":"7520927614819860480","contentEncryptType":0,"translateContent":"","chapterId":"1l93wyyn97p5n","dataSize":5705,"chapterOrder":23,"inChapterOrder":38,"volumeId":"7520927815609352211","volumeVersion":5},{"paragraphId":"7558397535196545034","paragraphType":1,"content":"{\"lines\":[{\"lineId\":\"500\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"乾隆十一年，知縣熊繹祖重建，東西科房十間，班房四間，\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"501\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"儀門一間，角門二間，牌坊一座，甬道、月臺夶署内土地祠\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"502\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"陳志、彭萼\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"503\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"采\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"504\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"重新洵署舊額記：乾隆庚申春三月，夏邑彭萼采來蒞三河，署多茅椽，署西一小楹，傾欲圯，命工整之，於塵士中，見舊額，字多磨滅。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"505\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"灌以水，見其上有宋文康公訓屬格言，宋冡宰公重新懸額，檄飭家大中丞兼山先生所作格言記。萼采拜而讀之，其宋文康公之\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"506\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"訓屬日，報朝廷某事榮，女母某事，寛，百姓幾分，留子孫幾分。其冡宰公激飭曰：此先相國文康公於國初開府畿東時訓屬格言也。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"507\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"迄今四十餘年，懸額猶存，字多漫漶。犖奉簡書，復觀察茲士，言念先澤，冰淵益凛，爰行重新，彰諸廳事，蓋自勉以期共勉云。家大\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"508\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"中丞記曰：丙寅春三月，通永觀察宋先生以重修懸額，勸飭寅箴，檄畿東所屬州邑，頒以式，大書二十字，細書八十四字。檄至，洵如。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"509\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"式懸邑署，泃宰彭鵬升堂入座，日所覿面。退而思曰：報者如答，榮者無沗，寛者弗亟，留者有餘，而況所邀者朝廷之爵祿也，所遺者\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"510\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":3,\"content\":\"\",\"pagePass\":{\"PageId\":\"7520927614819876864\"},\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"511\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"父母之體膚也，所供者，百姓之筋血也，所培者，子孫之元氣也。非報斯負，非榮斯辱；非寬斯竭，非留斯覆。語曰：一命之士，施及三黨。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"512\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"報孝經曰：立身行己，揚名顯親，可不思榮。孟子曰：用其一可不思緩，其二可不思寛。易曰：積善之家，必有餘慶。可不思留，吏不思愛。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"513\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"萼采讀罷，喜甚，急新之，懸諸廳，敬識於後曰：相國宋文康公書此格言，令子冡宰公復纘承之。家中丞公令三河時，記於座上。其姪\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"514\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"萼采讀罷守之相國爲鄉先賢，中丞乃伯氏行也。嚮慕往哲，景仰宗風，維日三省，儼如在上。丙寅迄今庚申，五十有五年矣。前正典\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"515\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"孫，我所傳於親也。思報、思榮，思寛、思留，作者，文康之詞也；述者者，觀察之心也。遵而懸之者，畿東屬吏也；筆而記之者，洵宰彭鵬也。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"516\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"因而欺朝廷，玷父母，累子孫，吏惟思長子孫，遂致剝百姓，負百姓，朝廷辱父母。成我者，君也，生我者，親也，百姓者，我所受於君也。子。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"517\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"型，昭垂宇宙，字裏行間，心跡雙淸。後之官。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"518\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"同治\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"519\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"茲士者，尙其升堂入座，常目存此二十字。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"520\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"元年知縣張鵬雲，\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"521\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"光緖元年知縣查光泰重修。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"522\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"采訪冊\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"523\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"典史署在縣治大門内。光緒三年，典史陳廉重修。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"524\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"采訪冊\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"525\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"朝鮮賓館康熙五十一年，價買民房修建，年久傾圯。乾隆二十四\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"526\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"年，知縣陳㫤捐置西街民房一所，鳩工修理。詳爲朝鮮貢使賓館。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"527\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"陳志\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"528\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":3,\"content\":\"\",\"pagePass\":{\"PageId\":\"7520927614819893248\"},\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"529\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"武淸縣治在城内正北。舊元衞帥府鎮撫衙。明隆慶六年，知縣李\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"530\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"賁修。倉庫、戒石亭久圯，設徵收櫃房，增吏書公廨。康熙十八年，地\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"531\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"震傾圯。二十口年，知縣祖應世重修大堂。三十六年，知縣章增印\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"532\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"重建大門、儀門、大堂并東西科房。乾隆二年，知縣陳惕增建收糧\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"533\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"所於大堂東，倉庫房於大堂西，今𠀤圯。大堂前爲露臺，并建皂快\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"534\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"班房於薹東二堂五間。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null}],\"indent\":0,\"textIndent\":false}","startPageId":"7520927614819860480","endPageId":"7520927614819893248","contentEncryptType":0,"translateContent":"","chapterId":"1l93wyyn97p5n","dataSize":5826,"chapterOrder":23,"inChapterOrder":39,"volumeId":"7520927815609352211","volumeVersion":5},{"paragraphId":"7558397535196561418","paragraphType":1,"content":"{\"lines\":[{\"lineId\":\"535\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"堂東爲瘦槐軒，知縣祖應世建公暇讀書\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"536\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"於此。前有古槐二株。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"537\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"武淸蔡志\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"538\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"二堂後爲内衙。監獄在大堂西。道光二\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"539\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"十三年知縣李正培，光緒元年知縣毛璋重修。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"540\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"蔡志\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"541\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"楊村驛巡檢住楊村，向未設署。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"542\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"蔡志：按：楊村驛丞兼管河巡檢。顧祖禹方輿紀要：楊村驛在縣南。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"543\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"五十里。建文三年，平安敗燕兵於楊村驛，進攻通州，不克。宣德初，駕征高煦，駐於楊村，即此。舊有巡司，今設管河通判駐焉。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"544\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"河西驛巡檢住河西務，向未設署。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"545\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"蔡志：按：河西務有同知一，主簿一。方輿紀要：河西務在縣東。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"546\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"北三十里。自元以來，皆爲漕運要道。明初，大運由直沽敗元人於河西務。今爲商民攢聚，舟航輻輳之地，設戸部分司駐焉。隆慶六\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"547\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":3,\"content\":\"\",\"pagePass\":{\"PageId\":\"7520927614819909632\"},\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"548\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"年築城環之，所以守禦。有河西驛，并置巡司於此。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"549\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"典史署在大堂西，今圯。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"550\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"蔡志\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"551\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"南八工下汎把總署在本汎十五號。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"552\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"永定河續志\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null}],\"indent\":0,\"textIndent\":false}","startPageId":"7520927614819893248","endPageId":"7520927614819909632","contentEncryptType":0,"translateContent":"","chapterId":"1l93wyyn97p5n","dataSize":2329,"chapterOrder":23,"inChapterOrder":40,"volumeId":"7520927815609352211","volumeVersion":5},{"paragraphId":"7558397535196577802","paragraphType":1,"content":"{\"lines\":[{\"lineId\":\"553\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"寶坻縣治在城西南隅。金大定時設縣，除令，以主縣事，\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"554\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"寶坻洪志，金劉晞。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"555\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"建寶坻縣記：幽州，秦爲上谷郡，厯漢、魏至隋、唐，或爲燕國，或顔新爲廣陽國，或爲涿郡，或爲范陽郡，廢置更易不常。唐末，劉仁恭帥\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"556\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"光僭偁燕王，置蘆臺軍於海口鎭以備州。後唐莊燕，其子守滄，宗命大將周德威破燕軍於平岡，復收蘆臺軍。同光中，以趙德鈞鎮。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"557\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"其地遂因蘆臺鹵地置鹽場。又舟行運鹽，東去京國一百八十里，開渠運，相其地高阜平濶，因置榷鹽院，謂之新倉，以則鹽復鹽貿。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"558\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"於瀛、莫間，上下資其利。淸泰三年，晉祖以遼主有援立之勞，遂以遺遼，攺爲燕京，因置新倉鎮。其後居民漸聚成井山，前後十六州。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"559\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"武淸北鄙孫村，度地之宜，分武淸𣸛縣、三河之民置香河肆，遂於隸焉。國朝天德間，詔建都于燕京。于時畿内縣仍以新倉重地鎮\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"560\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"鎮，頗爲偁首。以榷院自趙德鈞創始以來，厯遼室及國朝二百倉，反思補年，每咸所出，利源不竭，以補國用故也。主上中興，撥亂，正\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"561\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"品設副使之官。傔正隆殘弊，命有司改榷鹽院署置使司，陞爲五從，俸秩視諸剌郡，以重其事。于時居人市易，井肆連絡，加之河渠。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"562\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"于海嶠，篙師舟子，鼓楫揚帆，懋遷有無，雖干里之遠，旬日運漕，通定十而至。稻梁黍稷，魚蟹不可勝食，而材木亦不可勝用也。大有\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"563\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":3,\"content\":\"\",\"pagePass\":{\"PageId\":\"7520927614819926016\"},\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"564\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"一載辛卯冬至郊天，後鑾輿東巡，幸於是邦，厯覽之餘，顧謂侍臣：此新倉鎮人煙繁庶，可改爲縣。明年，有司承命，析香河縣東偏鄉。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"565\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"爲縣，謂鹽乃國之寶，取如坻如京之義，命之曰寶坻。閭萬五干家事。粤有縣令振威，列爲上縣，著於版籍。是嵗春，除令、丞、簿，以典其\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"566\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"縣丞忠武校尉李願，主簿儒林郎李拱昌縣將軍王䘰來尹是邑，尉昭信校尉孫吿中參豫連判，以備其職。時坊郭居民干有餘家。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"567\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"鄉東曰海濱，南曰廣川，西曰望都，北曰渠陽縣。自餘村閭，著爲四治，草創未有公𪠘。縣僚乃相地之宜，於渠水之南，太覺招提之西。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"568\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"北卜，卜爲縣廨。縣郛郭之外，招提之東，縣丞、主簿公署次之，又於尉廳焉。方營建間，吏民鼓舞，莫不子來。不一二年，皆以即敘。於是\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"569\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"礱石以紀其實。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"570\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"丞、簿佐之。縣令王诞於大覺寺之西卜爲縣治，東爲丞簿\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"571\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"署，縣比郭爲巡捕廳。元季以兵廢。明洪武元年，遷縣治於城之西\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"572\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"南隅，合丞、簿爲一所。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"573\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"本朝仍之。前爲大堂三間，大堂後爲後樂堂，左右兩側，東爲幕舍，\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"574\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"西爲庫房。堂前牌坊一座，堂左右書吏房各七間，儀門三間，大門\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"575\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"如之。監獄在儀門右，儀門東有土地祠，其東南爲寅賓館。天啟時，\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"576\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"知縣周詩雅題曰冰堂，有冰堂記。大堂久圯，僅存基址，\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"577\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"乃視事於\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"578\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":3,\"content\":\"\",\"pagePass\":{\"PageId\":\"7520927614819942400\"},\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"579\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"後樂堂，其堂左右之側房與幕舍、庫房皆撤，餘如舊。康熙五十四\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"580\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"年，後樂堂圯，知縣黄志元葺之。乾隆七年，知縣洪肇楙於三堂後\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"581\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"詳建屋十餘間，爲内署。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"582\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"洪志\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"583\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"同治六年，知縣吳履福，光緒元年知縣\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"584\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"管近修重修。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"585\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"采訪冊\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"586\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"典史署在縣治東。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"587\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"洪志：按：縣舊有主簿，其署在縣治西。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null}],\"indent\":0,\"textIndent\":false}","startPageId":"7520927614819909632","endPageId":"7520927614819942400","contentEncryptType":0,"translateContent":"","chapterId":"1l93wyyn97p5n","dataSize":5938,"chapterOrder":23,"inChapterOrder":41,"volumeId":"7520927815609352211","volumeVersion":5},{"paragraphId":"7558397535196594186","paragraphType":1,"content":"{\"lines\":[{\"lineId\":\"588\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"甯河縣治在城内正北。其大門、儀門、大堂及三堂，舊屬梁城所千\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"589\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"總署。雍正九年設縣，十年知縣楊奇昌，十二年知縣沈𤀹重修。三\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"590\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"堂前爲宅門，大堂之後爲三堂，大堂之東爲二堂，各三間。三堂後\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"591\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"爲知縣宅前，西書房在三堂之西，爲幕廳，監獄在大門内之西，𠀤\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"592\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"知縣沈濬建。後西書房。乾隆五年，知縣洪肇㮊增修。二十年，知縣\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"593\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"吳龍光増建南佳房二間，二堂後東書房五問。二十三年，知縣謝\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"594\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"洪恩增修。大堂前東西科房十二間，大堂之東土地祠三間。二十\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"595\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":3,\"content\":\"\",\"pagePass\":{\"PageId\":\"7520927614819958784\"},\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"596\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"六年，知縣徐堂增修大堂前東西班房，四十年，知縣關廷牧重修。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"597\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"甯河關志\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"598\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"典史署在儀門西。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"599\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"關志\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"600\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"把總署在城南街。雍正十一年，里人候選州同馬自誠、候選訓導\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"601\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"馬天相捐地建。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"602\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"關志\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"603\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"蘆臺場鹽大使署舊基在蘆台街中，雍正年間，署圯，債屋而居。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null}],\"indent\":0,\"textIndent\":false}","startPageId":"7520927614819942400","endPageId":"7520927614819958784","contentEncryptType":0,"translateContent":"","chapterId":"1l93wyyn97p5n","dataSize":2131,"chapterOrder":23,"inChapterOrder":42,"volumeId":"7520927815609352211","volumeVersion":5},{"paragraphId":"7535740238317666354","paragraphType":1,"content":"{\"lines\":[{\"lineId\":\"604\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"别\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"605\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"有公館一在興寶神祠側，爲薊永分司巡厯掣鹽之所，名曰鹽亭\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"606\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"con