","endPageId":"7520927614819975168","contentEncryptType":0,"translateContent":"","chapterId":"1l93wyyn97p5n","dataSize":754,"chapterOrder":23,"inChapterOrder":48,"volumeId":"7520927815609352211","volumeVersion":5},{"paragraphId":"7558397535196610570","paragraphType":1,"content":"{\"lines\":[{\"lineId\":\"634\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"順義縣治在城内正北。明洪武初建，\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"635\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"順義黄𢖽：按：順義縣，金元杕爲順州，明洪武二年降爲。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"636\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":3,\"content\":\"\",\"pagePass\":{\"PageId\":\"7520927614819991552\"},\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"637\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"縣元梁宜順州公廨記畧：前代州治爲小城，方二里許，四隅角樓，遺跡尙存。至元二年，節度使劉瑜建大廳并長廊。二十八年，知\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"638\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"州大興王居政於廳左右搆捕盜所吏目幕次，復搆架閣庫祗候直舍。大德七年，知州鉅野段廷珪作後廨，𠀤東西房。皇慶初，知州。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"639\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"大興梁彦義起儀門，高三丈餘，翰林學士淸河元明善爲之記。其驛館，至元十八年，州倅李讓剏焉。餘詳金石。元明善順州儀門\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"640\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"記畧：古者諸侯三門，皋門、應門、路門。今之州，準古伯、子男之國，作儀門，禮也。温榆水之陽，有古城焉，曰順州，隸大都路。地沃而民湻。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"641\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"國家罷兵百年，涵懦撫育，生殖日繁，蔚爲饒郡。郡城據亢爽地，郡廨特當其亢。亢有故儀門址，至大四年，知州事梁君彥義始來明。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"642\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"年，百廢次第舉，民用大和。乃謀諸監郡，將建岑樓於址，僉曰：休哉！民皆子趨以獻功。肇事於皇慶元年秋七月，畢工於二年夏六月。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"643\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"舊治大堂。康熙十八年，地震傾圯。五十五年，知縣黃成章以風水\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"644\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"不善，改昔之住宅爲大堂三間，額曰行義堂。二堂三間，左厨房、右\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"645\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"書房、右廊房，三堂三間。又內書房三間，大堂右爲寅賓館，館後廊\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"646\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"房三間，大門二，門外𠀤有照壁。監獄在舊署西墀南。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"647\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"黄志\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"648\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"典史署在縣治左側。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"649\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"黃志\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"650\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":1,\"content\":\"密雲縣治在舊城鼓樓西。明萬麻間，知縣邢玠、張世則重建。\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"651\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"密雲丁志\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"652\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":3,\"content\":\"\",\"pagePass\":{\"PageId\":\"7520927614820007936\"},\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"653\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"重修密雲縣碑記：密雲縣治，舊傳物土，仍勝國之舊，入國朝屢增葺之，迄今二百餘年，傾倚枝柱，不足以肅臨民之體。且東西二\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"654\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"署廢，不知何時，至今丞幕君僦代舍以居。萬麻元年，明府益都邢君玠來視邑事，慨然念之，顧以材詘民窶，私識諸心，未誦言也。會\",\"logicSentenceId\":\"0\",\"marginNoteIdList\":null,\"pinYin\":null},{\"lineId\":\"655\",\"lineNum\":0,\"lineType\":2,\"content\":\"制府奉乘障之役，諸戲下營帥俱有羡材，於是邢君請以濟凝度。又以舊額稍隘，西闢地四畝足